     1654      run proc-find-corr-date in this-procedure(yes, input frame Dialog-Frame sch-corr-date) no-error.
     1655     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1656   END.
     1657   ON RETURN OF sch-corr-date IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
