     1677   ON RETURN OF sch-db-num IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1678   DO:
     1679     run proc-find-db-num in this-procedure(no, input frame Dialog-Frame sch-db-num) no-error.
     1680     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
